      "text": "A continuous EIGHT-SECOND epic final-boss battle shot, beginning from the supplied painted illustration. The camera holds a wide composition behind the five small heroes, looking upward at colossal Aevos. There is ONE large blue-brown PLANET over his raised hand on screen left. 0–2 seconds: Aevos draws that planet-bearing arm back and turns his shoulder, visibly winding up a throw. 2–4 seconds: he forcefully SWINGS HIS ARM FORWARD and RELEASES the entire planet from his hand. His hand is now empty. The round world flies diagonally downward from the upper left straight toward the party in the lower center, with continents, cloud bands and a blazing atmospheric trail clearly visible as it approaches. 4–6 seconds: the planet SMASHES INTO the bright blue protective dome in front of Arin and his companions, producing a blinding blue-gold impact ring, shockwave and flying rocky fragments. The blue shield bows inward and cracks under the enormous force. 6–8 seconds: the flash clears enough to reveal the five companions still together, forced to one knee but holding the fractured shield, with Aevos looming beyond the falling debris. The planet has left his hand and has hit the shield; it must not stay hovering beside him. Keep Arin with his cyan sword and kite shield, Mira with her ring staff, broad Orin with his rectangular tower shield, one red mechanical robot Zara and exactly ONE normal four-legged golden dog Milo safely crouched behind them. Long silver-haired Kael remains at the far right edge watching; no new people. All heroes face the boss throughout, plant their feet, brace and fight to hold their ground. Stable character identities and anatomy, no running, no walking backward, no camera cut, no camera orbit. Preserve the cinematic painted cosmic fantasy style. No speech, lip movement, subtitles, lettering or logos. Deep rushing cosmic energy, thunderous impact and resonant shield cracking only."
    },
